  "label": "AWS EC2 (Extended)",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A clone of the AWS EC2 connector that adds a generic boto3 passthrough operation, so any AWS API action can be called without waiting for a curated operation to exist. Also repairs security-group rule operations, where the platform's numeric-string coercion makes IpProtocol '-1' (all protocols) unreachable. Installs alongside the stock connector and needs its own configuration.",
